    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1158">

                <pb facs="1173" n="1163" sameAs="frus:frus1949v09/pg1163"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">393.115/11–1549: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at Shanghai</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">McConaughy</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Secretary of State </hi><anchor n="7" xml:id="d1158-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-11-15">November 15,
                        1949</date>.<lb/>[Received November 15—10:13 a. m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Unnumbered. Message from master <hi rendition="#italic">Flying Cloud</hi> dated
                    November 15 at 1845 hours local time states that <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Cloud</hi> now anchored north of Fairway buoy (mouth of Yangtze), that
                    Chinese National gunboat fired hundreds of rounds at ship of various calibers,
                    including 3–inch, causing some damage to vessel’s structure. Vessel holes
                    inside. Master states making repairs tonight (November 15) weather permitting.
                        <pb facs="1174" n="1164" xml:id="pg1164"/> Presume foregoing sent
                    immediately after <hi rendition="#italic">Cloud</hi> ran blockade and is first
                    message from master since ship left Shanghai November 14 [<hi
                        rendition="#italic">13</hi>] at 1130 hours local time.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">McConaughy</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1158-f1" n="7" type="source" xml:id="d1158-f1-content">
                <p>Repeated to the Chargé in China as telCan No. 757, November 16, 4 p. m.</p>
            </note>
